OL,3,GNEWSAStrictly judge on Sussex dance
OL,4,Aroots, shows and memoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrictly Come Dancing star-turned-judge
OL,7,FAnton Du Beke says he has a "big
OL,8,Frelationship with Sussex" ahead of the
OL,9,Frelease of his debut memoir.
OL,11,FThe professional dancer, originally
OL,12,Ffrom Sevenoaks in Kent, is bringing his
OL,13,Fshow that accompanies the book - Steps
OL,14,Fin Time - to Congress Theatre in
OL,15,FEastbourne on 28 October.
OL,17,FSteps in Time focuses on stories and
OL,18,Fmemories about his life pre-Strictly
OL,19,Fthrough a Q&A.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
